            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. Unit members will have the right, upon written request, to review the contents of their official personnel file located in the office of the deputy superintendent for supportive services. If the unit member wishes to be accompanied by another person or a representative of the Council during such a review, that request must be entered in writing.",
